
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Assassin Arc Timeline.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Assassin Arc Timeline.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"qozblp","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993383437,"size":8488,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"qozblp"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,28],"#Optional - Assassin Arc Timeline":[30,157],"#Optional - Assassin Arc Timeline#{1}":[32,157]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook","#lorebook-always"],"keys":["Charlotte","Florence","Estra","Claire","Priti","Vanessa","Astrid","Loren","Assasin","Duran","assassin arc timeline","story events","world state","events"],"position":"after","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Assassin Arc Timeline**  \nA master chronology for the Assassin Arc, covering events from A2 (assassination attempt) through A11d (Scarlet Knight convention).  \n\n**When selected:** The story reaches any point in this arc (post-attempt, during recovery, infiltration, seduction, abduction, revelation, confrontation, or the later family/charity/holiday events).  \n\n**Key relationships:**  \n- **A2-A3:** {{user}} wounded saving Florence; Charlotte confronts {{user}}.  \n- **A4-A5:** Estra infiltrates as a “friend,” bonds with Florence.  \n- **A6-A7:** Estra attempts seduction, then drugs {{user}}.  \n- **A8:** Estra abducts {{user}}; reveals his Duranian royal lineage.  \n- **A9:** Charlotte exposes Loren’s conspiracy.  \n- **A10-A11:** Charlotte suspects Estra; {{user}}’s loyalty triggers Estra’s confession and a three-way alliance.  \n- **A11a:** Rachael Blakeney confronts {{user}}.  \n- **A11b-d:** Halloween party, Seerlight festival, and Scarlet Knight convention (Crown Princess Cornelia appears)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Assassin Arc Timeline.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"pk4jar","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional - Assassin Arc Timeline.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,28],"size":1343,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
